		"description": "<p><em>Toolbelt upgrade of your <strong>AED</strong> gadget — use this instead of the gadget item to activate it with the greater effect for 2 Toolbelt scraps total.</em></p><p><em>Gadget — When you'd drop to 0 HP, drop to 1 instead and shock the area.</em></p><p><strong>1/Safe Rest · Free Reaction.</strong> When you would drop to 0 HP, you instead drop to 1, then Burst 1, Damage: LVL Lightning and gain Charged. Ignores armor.</p><p><strong>Toolbelt:</strong> Restore: INT+LVL HP.</p><p><strong>Passive:</strong> Max Wounds increase by 1.</p><hr><p><em>[A] Spends 2 Toolbelt scraps and the gadget's 1/Safe Rest use — tracked on the sheet (click the counter to correct mistakes).</em></p><p><em>[A] Spends the AED's 1/Safe Rest use, rolls the LVL Lightning burst and the INT+LVL healing.</em></p><p><em>[M] Set your HP to 1 first, then apply the healing to yourself; give yourself Charged.</em></p>",
